Race condition: concurrent `ensureTable` calls can both pass the `has(name)` check before either adds to the set, causing both to execute DDL. This causes PostgreSQL `pg_type` duplicate key errors as noted in the Drizzle implementation comment. Should use promise-based locking like Drizzle attempted.

